### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:3000/orders

### Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/1

### Get nonexistent order - should return 404
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/99

### Create a valid order - should return 201
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Grace",
  "items": ["Chocolate Cake", "Croissant"],
  "total": 9000,
  "phone": "677123456"
}

### Invalid order - empty items - should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "John",
  "items": [],
  "total": 5000,
  "phone": "677987654"
}

### Invalid order - missing phone - should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Mary",
  "items": ["Baguette"],
  "total": 3500
}
